        <mxCell id="ctl" value="&lt;b&gt;Task controller&lt;/b&gt; · live gate pending&#10;solo implementer · a room per task&#10;run meter: revokes a run at its&#10;token cap (reads VictoriaMetrics)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;shadow=1;fillColor=#EEF2FF;strokeColor=#6366F1;fontColor=#1E293B;" vertex="1" parent="sp3"><mxGeometry x="20" y="140" width="250" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
